<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine monthly grain/oilseed shipments.</title>
<headline>Argentine monthly grain/oilseed shipments.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat January grain shipment figures (tonnes) (year-earlier in brackets).</p>
<p> Wheat    2,490,871  (752,196)</p>
<p> Maize	112,492   (72,353)</p>
<p> Sorghum	  nil	(nil)</p>
<p> Barley	24,435	(nil)</p>
<p> Soybeans	 966	(nil)</p>
<p> Sunseed	  545	(nil)</p>
<p> Others	17,289    (3,789)</p>
<p>Principal destinations in January were as follows (tonnes):</p>
<p>WHEAT: Turkey 474,332; Brazil 466,423; Egypt 308,965; Iran 196,669; Cuba 122,291; Indonesia 109,870</p>
<p>MAIZE: Brazil 24,612; Britain 23,956; Cuba 14,748; Peru 11,890; Iran 11,574; Colombia 10,437</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
